# Breaks at the Vaneshade estate (X7): reachable only by letter.
schedule_break: away
relations: kael:-10 bram:5 nessa:-5
voice: Clipped and formal; sarcastic when hurt. Never says "please" first, never admits to being tired, apologises by doing something useful.
desc: Brilliant, impatient and used to winning. She treats everyone as either a rival or furniture — and is quietly lonely about it.

