# Renamed on 2026-10-15: this character was "Mira" (id `mira`, Chinese 米拉) and is now Mir (id `mir`, 米尔), they/them.
# Every id was renamed with it (`mir_*`, `letter_mir_*`, `art_mir_collab`, `ending_beloved_mir`, `mir.*` facts).
# Older records (tools/migrations/, past reviews) still use the old name; never reintroduce it in content.
