pronouns: they/them
house: none
color: #3f7a4f
romance: false
look: hair:3 skin:3 style:2
tags: thornwick student
age: 19
role: outsider
seeks: sometimes
traits: funny curious ambitious loyal
interests: painting gossip theatre cards
stats: arcana 26 lore 20 alchemy 10 charm 30 vigor 12 guile 28 wealth 2
schedule_break: away
# A pen pal (feedback 2026-10-15): reached only by letter, and never cast in other people's cards.
distant: true
voice: Writes the way they talk: fast, sly, all asides and crossings-out. Signs every letter with a new insult. Means every kind word, and hides them in postscripts.
desc: A Thornwick illusionist who answered a letter to "a Lumenhold student chosen at random" and kept writing. Insufferable, by their own account, and the best correspondent you have.

